@machine-126/dsh-alert-sound README · 常见问题：```sh
dsh plugin --profile <你的profile> remove @machine-126/dsh-alert-sound
```

@machine-126/dsh-alert-sound README · 致谢：- 检测思路（从 `running` 与挂起交互推导审批 / 提问 / 完成）：[dsh-session-notification](https://github.com/dingyi222666/dsh-session-notification)（BSD-3-Clause）
- 「任务完成提示音」这个概念：[dsh-chime](https://github.com/HtO404/dsh-chime)（Apache-2.0）
- 打包结构与 web 客户端插件形态：官方文档 `docs/user/develop/basic/publish.md`，以及 [dsh-plugin-tts](https://github.com/1624318455/dsh-plugin-tts)、[dsh-status-rotator](https://github.com/01Virex/dsh-status-rotator)、[dsh-web-ui-notify](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-web-ui-notify)

@machine-126/dsh-alert-sound README · The five kinds：> What it watches: `running` and the pending interaction's kind from `uiSession.sessionStatus`, plus the session snapshot's `lastAgentError`.

> The fifth kind is off by default: **it only fires once "Stall detection" is enabled**. It judges by the session's update timestamp, so it is a heuristic.

Available sounds: Ding-dong / Low / Tap / Alert / Voice / Custom / Mute.

@machine-126/dsh-alert-sound README · Acknowledgements：- Detection approach (`running` and the pending interaction → approval / question / completion): [dsh-session-notification](https://github.com/dingyi222666/dsh-session-notification) (BSD-3-Clause)
- The "task finished" chime idea: [dsh-chime](https://github.com/HtO404/dsh-chime) (Apache-2.0)
- Packaging and web-client plugin form: the official `docs/user/develop/basic/publish.md`, plus [dsh-plugin-tts](https://github.com/1624318455/dsh-plugin-tts), [dsh-status-rotator](https://github.com/01Virex/dsh-status-rotator) and [dsh-web-ui-notify](https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-web-ui-notify)
